---
import BlogPostLayout from '../../../../layouts/BlogPostLayout.astro';

const title = "Commerce Courses for Science Students Switching to Commerce in India";
const seoTitle = "Commerce Courses for Science Students Switching Streams in India";
const description = "Commerce courses for science students switching in India: bridge options after 12th, degrees, professional exams and proof of fit for accounting and finance.";
const seoDescription = "Commerce courses for science students switching in India: bridge options after 12th, degrees, professional exams and proof of fit for accounting and finance.";
const canonical = "https://futurecareerschool.com/blog/college-degrees/commerce-courses-for-science-students-switching-india/";
const publishedDateISO = "2026-10-30";
const publishedDateLabel = "30 October 2026";
const authorName = "Shivanshi Sehgal";
const authorUrl = "https://futurecareerschool.com/about/shivanshi-sehgal/";
const authorRole = "Career researcher and writer";

const faqItems = [
  {
    "q": "Can science students move to commerce?",
    "a": "Yes, commonly."
  },
  {
    "q": "Is numeracy an advantage?",
    "a": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "q": "Which course is best?",
    "a": "Depends on your goal."
  },
  {
    "q": "Do I need accounting first?",
    "a": "Basics help."
  },
  {
    "q": "Can I do professional exams?",
    "a": "Check eligibility."
  },
  {
    "q": "Will AI affect commerce jobs?",
    "a": "Bookkeeping changes. Advice stays."
  }
];

const faqJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  mainEntity: faqItems.map((item) => ({
    "@type": "Question",
    name: item.q,
    acceptedAnswer: { "@type": "Answer", text: item.a },
  })),
};
---

<BlogPostLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  seoTitle={seoTitle}
  seoDescription={seoDescription}
  canonical={canonical}
  category="college-degrees"
  publishedAt={publishedDateISO}
  publishedLabel={publishedDateLabel}
  authorName={authorName}
  authorUrl={authorUrl}
  authorRole={authorRole}
  jsonLdExtras={[faqJsonLd]}
>
  <p class="lead-para">
    Commerce courses for science students switching include BCom and BBA after class 12, professional foundation exams such as accounting and company secretary routes, and short skill courses in accounting and data, and science students often bring strong numeracy that helps in finance.
  </p>

  <div class="key-takeaways">
    <p class="key-takeaways__label">The short version</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Short answer:</strong> Check eligibility for the target course, learn accounting basics early and use your science numeracy as a strength.</li>
      <li><strong>What to verify:</strong> Eligibility rules and exam patterns change. Check official pages for each course and avoid agents promising guaranteed results.</li>
      <li><strong>Growth:</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities come from finished work in one lane. Proof you can show supports an earlier path to financial freedom.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p>
    Switching from science to commerce is common. The gap is mostly vocabulary and conventions, not ability.
  </p>
  <p class="more-guides">If this decision carries real money or time, <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/career-counselling-for-commerce-students/">career counselling for commerce students</a> is the direct route, and more <a href="/blog/college-degrees/">College and Degrees guides</a> sit in the same section.</p>

  <nav class="jump-nav" aria-label="Article sections">
    <p class="jump-nav__label">Jump to section</p>
    <ul class="jump-nav__list">
      <li><a href="#options">Options</a></li>
      <li><a href="#bridge">Bridge</a></li>
      <li><a href="#plan">Plan</a></li>
      <li><a href="#routes">Routes</a></li>
      <li><a href="#reality">Pay, growth and AI</a></li>
      <li><a href="#learn">Learn it cheaply</a></li>
      <li><a href="#money">Money</a></li>
      <li><a href="#checkpoint">The 4-Checkpoint Protocol</a></li>
