      <div class="ladder-step__num">04</div>
      <div>
        <div class="ladder-step__title">Apply and prepare</div>
        <p>Plan study time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 id="routes">Routes for commerce courses for science students switching, strongest growth first</h2>
  <p>
