    </div>
    <div class="route-card">
      <div class="route-card__top">
        <span class="route-card__n">02</span>
        <span class="chip chip--mid">Scalable with a business layer</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Degree route</h3>
      <p class="route-card__why">Study route.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Colleges.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Degree.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Syllabus gap.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Move to jobs or exams.</p>
