      <p class="route-card__why">Data route.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>Who pays you</span>Colleges.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Degree.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Maths.</p>
