  <h2 id="reality">Pay, growth and AI for commerce courses for science students switching</h2>
  <p>
    Employers pay for accurate, timely records. The first skill is clean bookkeeping.
  </p>
  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      Syllabus gaps are real, exams are demanding and agents prey on switchers. We give no financial advice.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p>
    Growth comes from finance depth, professional credentials and analytics skills.
  </p>
  <p>
    Bookkeeping is being automated. Staged path: now, learn the tools; later, own analysis, advice and trust.
  </p>
