  </p>
  <p>
    Read also <a href="/blog/college-degrees/bba-vs-bcom-india-which-to-choose-after-12th/">BBA vs BCom</a>, <a href="/blog/college-degrees/short-term-courses-for-commerce-students-3-to-6-months-india/">short-term courses for commerce students</a> and <a href="/blog/career-options/business-analytics-career-for-commerce-students-india/">business analytics career for commerce students</a>.
